  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> the average waist size for women in the U.S. is <strong>38.5&nbsp;inches (98&nbsp;cm)</strong>, measured at the top of the hip bone (NHANES 2021&ndash;2023, women 20+). For health, keep it under <strong>35&nbsp;in (88&nbsp;cm)</strong>, ideally under 31.5&nbsp;in, and under half your height.</p></div>

